::  Layout cell -- color and position composed in one shape.
::  Seven fields: the three channels of layout-color plus the four
::  dimensions of layout-rect. Proves that the value model composes
::  layout concerns into a single record a gate can validate.
+$  layout-cell-shape
  $:  red=@u32
      green=@u32
      blue=@u32
      col=@u32
      row=@u32
      width=@u32
      height=@u32
  ==
